 822→ * Uses add-before-remove pattern to prevent data loss on failure.
 823→ * FilePointer contains fileMetaIpnsName which stays the same across moves --
 824→ * no file IPNS record changes needed, only folder metadata changes.
 825→ *
 826→ * @param params.fileId - ID of file to move
